{"1644600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BSurfing", "steam_appid": 1644600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/a321d821c2fbc76bf51ad00e8b5210b5.poster.avif?t=1670159834\" width=384 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/a321d821c2fbc76bf51ad00e8b5210b5.webm?t=1670159834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/a321d821c2fbc76bf51ad00e8b5210b5.mp4?t=1670159834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i><strong>BSurfing</strong> is a fun parkour game featuring <i>famous</i> mechanics, such as surfing and bhopping. There are a lot of maps to play in. Speedrun the levels to earn a spot on the leaderboards. Customize your player with gloves, skins and trails!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bhop</h2></strong></h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/ba477cd767a12d30866084118ea234ea.poster.avif?t=1670159834\" width=600 height=285 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/ba477cd767a12d30866084118ea234ea.webm?t=1670159834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Bhop, aka Bunnyhopping, is one of the two most important skills in the game. Get high speeds by mastering this skill!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surfing</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/f97c797b5911db6caf7d44599021c1eb.poster.avif?t=1670159834\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/f97c797b5911db6caf7d44599021c1eb.webm?t=1670159834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644600/extras/f97c797b5911db6caf7d44599021c1eb.mp4?t=1670159834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Surfing is the second important skill in the game. Surf and jump between ramps to get dazzling high speeds and ensure a place on the leaderboards!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2></h2>There are <strong>a lot</strong> of maps in the game, currently 30+ maps!<u>More and more</u> will be added frequently.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2></h2>Customize your <strong><i><u>WIDE BEAN</u></i></strong> with <i>EPIC</i> knives, skins, gloves and <strong>cool</strong> trails!. You can see some of the items in the trailer! More and more skins will be added frequently too, just like maps! Want your own custom skin to be featured in-game? Join the discord server and submit your designs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrun Community</h2></h2></h2></h2>The game has a speedrunny side if you want to compete against other players. There are leaderboards to show the best times! Join the <i>discord</i> server for the speedrun community. A speedrun category will be coming soon on an official speedrun website! For now go to the discord.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bhop</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Surfing</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customization</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large variety of maps</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Speedrun</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Leaderboards</li></ul><br><br>Plans for the future of the game:<br>- Multiplayer<br>- Workshop maps<br>- Tournaments<br><br>Are you interested in